      "value": "To reproduce:\n\n- Create a world project.\n\n- Make sure there is a baked light source and a static object, so that it attempts to bake. My project was moderately complex at the time, but it's possible it could not matter on complexity.\n\n- Add a VRC look constraint (that's what broke, but it may be any or all vrc constraints).\n\n- Attempt to bake lighting.",
